# Selection", Gold first) and Gold: A@2400; Silver: RIGHT@2300, A@2400; Bronze: RIGHT@2300, RIGHT@2340, A@2420
# (tools/transfer_pw.sh); or Cable: gs1_send_cable.keys.
START@1500-1502,R+LEFT@1560-1640,RIGHT@1700-1702,RIGHT@1730-1732,RIGHT@1760-1762,RIGHT@1790-1792
A@1850-1852,A@1950-1952
